---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "SUBMITTED" as SUBMITTED
  state "IN REVIEW" as IN_REVIEW
  state "CHANGES REQUESTED" as CHANGES_REQUESTED
  state "REJECTED" as REJECTED
  state "PUBLISHED" as PUBLISHED
  state "SUSPENDED" as SUSPENDED
  state "ARCHIVED" as ARCHIVED

  [*] --> SUBMITTED : Seller publishes story / new version [approved seller, no personal info]
  SUBMITTED --> IN_REVIEW : Specialist claims review [narration ready]
  IN_REVIEW --> PUBLISHED : Approve [all pages viewed]
  IN_REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : Request changes [comment]
  IN_REVIEW --> REJECTED : Reject [comment, optional strike]
  PUBLISHED --> SUSPENDED : Reports reach threshold / specialist suspends
  SUSPENDED --> PUBLISHED : Follow-up review approved
  SUSPENDED --> ARCHIVED : Follow-up review taken down [strike]
  PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED : Random audit taken down [strike]
  PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED : Newer version approved (buyers moved to new listing)
  CHANGES_REQUESTED --> [*] : Seller submits a new listing
  REJECTED --> [*]
  ARCHIVED --> [*]
